WEBVTT

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:24.100
Sado Sea Tour

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.780
It's the first game of the Japanese series!

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.290
Will it be the Pacific League
this year, or last year's...

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:25.780
What the...

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.230
The seismic sensors are reading level two,

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.200
but all of our measurements
are showing level eight!

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.240
I can't believe this!

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.040
Such a thing is impossible!

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.600
Sadogashima

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.600
Hayakawa

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.770
Mary, you're pregnant,
you shouldn't be out here.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:18.070
This is the first phenomenon
like this in all of history, Joe.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:20.300
I know that, but...

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.100
We need to quickly record our observations.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:03.130
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:03.130
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:10.640
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:10.640
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:19.750
With our eyes on the future

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:19.750
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:25.850
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:25.850
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:35.490
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:35.490
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:43.000
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:43.000
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.710
Fly to the Neverland

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.710
Fly to the Neverland

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:58.220
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:58.220
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:11.700
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:16.670
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.450
It was the Day of Conjunction.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.940
Yes, twelve years have passed since the day

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:26.850
when the Pillar of Darkness
of Chaos first appeared.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.390
But now another new journey...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.660
A new odyssey is about to begin.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:43.670
That place is undoubtedly...

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.740
Seems like even the tourists have
stopped coming in such big numbers.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.500
Sadogashima

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.500
The Pillar of Darkness Tour Ship

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.500
Not Currently Running

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:04.430
Yeah, I heard another ship disappeared entirely!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:08.330
See, I'm sure that pillar is
connected to Wonderland.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:11.870
The subway workers are constantly
disappearing too...

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.490
It's been closed for a while now, hasn't it?

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.760
What will we do if we can't come back either?

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.210
We'll be fine.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:25.610
After all, Mom and Dad
made it back at least once.

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.190
It's not coming, is it?

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.090
We've still got two or three minutes to go.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.360
Sis, aren't you scared?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:43.260
We're going out to look for Mom and Dad.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.760
There's no time to be scared.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:48.430
I guess you're right.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.910
Sis...

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.040
So it was really true.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:08.810
It's coming!

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:33.980
It opened.

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.450
Man, it's dark.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.290
Do we get in?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.450
We do! That's why we came here!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.600
That sounds like the departure bell.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:50.830
That's not good!

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.720
Hurry!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.940
It's just a normal subway train.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:43.570
Mom and Dad took this train, didn't they?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.620
This is Pacifist. Currently...

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.330
There's someone else on the train!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.540
Good evening!

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.340
That's a weird laugh.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.270
It's like you're talking down to us kids.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.280
Sis!

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.940
I'm sorry.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:16.380
So, are you guys the ghosts
that live on this train?

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.350
Aren't you the ghost here?!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.080
Come on, Sis!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:26.260
We're going to Wonderland
in search of our mom and dad.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.930
Wonderland?

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:31.800
Yeah, they say that the Pillar of Darkness
is connected to Wonderland.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.640
That's what my dad said in
this book that they wrote.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.350
Day of Conjunction

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.710
"Day of Conjunction,"

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:43.010
the book from Professor Hayakawa, famous for
his research on the physics of Wonderland.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:48.150
They wrote that when they went to
Wonderland, they took a subway.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.980
When we looked on the net,

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.420
we found there was a rumor that said
we could get on the train at precisely

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.590
thirteen seconds past 12:13 AM
on the night of a full moon.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.660
I'm Yu Hayakawa, and this is my older sister.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.370
Ai Hayakawa. He calls me his older
sister, but we're really twins.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.200
I see, I'm Lisa...

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.760
So why are you on this subway?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.330
Well...

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.110
We're floating!

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:19.770
Or we're falling!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.350
It looks like we've stopped.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.600
Is this Wonderland?!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.240
Mom and Dad should be here somewhere.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.040
It looks like we can climb up, but...

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.240
Then we'll climb!

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:49.710
That's why we came here, isn't it?!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.850
We've still got more to climb?

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:53.750
That's why we came here, isn't it?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.770
I can see something a little further up
that looks like an exit.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.560
Miss Lisa, are you also looking for
someone who disappeared in Wonderland?

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.550
It's got to be her boyfriend!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.520
You can just call me Lisa.

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.700
We're finally out!

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.570
Is this Wonderland?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:29.650
What is this place? Is this really Wonderland?

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.880
This looks just like a normal park from
an apartment complex, but...

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.940
Except for the sky.

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.990
You guys shouldn't wander about around here.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.360
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.820
But this is a normal slide, just like
from any other place.

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:50.330
This is no building! They're all plants!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.440
I'm sorry!

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.020
What happened?

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.980
This place isn't normal!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:11.920
It really is Wonderland!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.530
Is something over there?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.540
Oh, that's right!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.010
Hey, come here.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.320
Hey... Hey, it's tasty...

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.060
I've got some good choco-chocolate
here for you, boy!

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:46.960
Yu! What are you doing with
our precious food supply?

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.470
Chomp?

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:56.990
What?!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.700
Sis!

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:02.710
Are you all right?

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.240
I'm seeing all sorts of colors...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.450
Day of Conjunction

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.450
World Wide Best Seller!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.450
Maybe that guy was one of those birds
of happiness that live in Wonderland

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.680
from the book that Mom and Dad wrote.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.920
Mr. Birdy!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.010
Wait!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:18.680
Mr. Birdy!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.050
You haven't seen our parents
by any chance, have you?!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.190
Where could he have gone off to?

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.860
Ouch!

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:35.540
A leg!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.120
What happened?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.310
Someone...

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:49.020
Is he dead?

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.130
Where is this place?

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.470
We were going to ask you the same thing!

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:10.570
Mister, did you wander into Wonderland too?

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.610
Wonderland?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:17.380
Is that scoundrel here too?

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:20.490
Scoundrel? Are you looking for someone?

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:21.460
Excuse me...

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:23.050
Hey, Mister, who are you?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:27.390
I have forgotten my name.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.900
How troublesome.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.770
What is that thing?

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.340
It looks like some kind of vehicle.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:44.180
So does that mean that someone is in it?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.980
No...

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.550
With such a disgusting flow of energy...

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.920
It can't be human.

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.420
It's a bomb!

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:54.410
Everyone, run!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.680
Run away!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:10.930
It doesn't look like it really was a bomb.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.560
A mushroom?

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.680
It's looking at us!

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:34.800
This guy is bad news!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:36.830
Does he plan on attacking us?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.200
Probably.

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.400
It's coming!

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:06.790
Wow!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.520
She totally took care of him!

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:12.330
I knew you weren't a normal person.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.270
That Kigen Arts trick I just did...

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:19.670
It's just sort of like a martial art.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.040
Kigen Arts?

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:39.920
Hurry up and take care of him!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.920
I don't think I can. He's a little too big.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:41.930
Let's run away!

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.500
He's catching up with us!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.030
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:52.030
Run until you find a place where you can hide.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:53.600
Oh, no!

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:53.600
It's a cliff!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.890
Are you guys okay?

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.940
For now...

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:22.830
This really doesn't look good!

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:26.270
What should we do?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.010
It's the guy from before.

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:34.420
He survived?

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.680
Help us!

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.080
It has moved.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:47.290
Soil... My power!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.900
The Magun has thawed!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:23.900
Note: Magun means Demon Gun

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:28.220
Magun?

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:35.600
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:42.000
The origin of all things, Mother Black!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:49.250
Soil?

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:53.960
A heat that will scorch all things, Fire Red!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:03.940
And finally, the critical point of all
things, Burning Gold!

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:14.470
What an amazing flow of energy!

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:21.480
Burn! I summon you, Phoenix!

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:29.350
Wow!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.660
That man...

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.920
Kaze...

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:35.360
I am...

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:43.560
Unlimited...

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:55.650
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.020
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.140
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.490
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.390
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:07.060
It's just like torture

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.500
I can't take it

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.520
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.000
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.490
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Douka kamisama

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.570
Please, God

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.880
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:28.420
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.050
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:37.060
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.890
You are now the only person

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:42.230
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:44.930
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:48.140
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.070
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:57.040
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:02.220
On the inside

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:05.190
Something is going to start

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.920
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:12.030
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.390
All right!

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:19.600
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:25.910
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:27.970
His name is Kaze.

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:30.580
He is a destroyer.

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:36.570
Anyone who stands before him
will be defeated by the Soil.

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:45.080
Next time I will return to
offer my Unlimited guidance.
